# Live provider configs — one per cloud, at the repo root.
#
# These hold REAL values: hostnames, account and subscription ids, DNS zone ids,
# a service-principal client id, an operator's email, and paths to local
# credential files. This repository is public, so they are deliberately not
# tracked — publishing them maps an operator's cloud estate for no benefit, and
# they are personal working files rather than anything the platform needs.
#
# The generic, placeholder-only versions ARE tracked, in examples/:
#   examples/{aws,azure,gcp,digitalocean,civo}-config.yaml
# plus examples/config.yaml, the annotated master template. Docs and tests point
# at those, never at the files below.
config.aws.yaml
config.azure.yaml
config.gcp.yaml
config.digitalocean.yaml
config.civo.yaml
